      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 (FL2VA): text, first frame and last frame to video\n\n[MiniMax H3](https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3) (33B, Qwen3-VL-32B text encoder) generates video with\nstereo audio in one pass. Without frames it is text to video; the first frame, the last frame or both make it\nimage to video. Write the shots, the camera move with its speed, and the audio (dialogue in quotes) in one block;\nthere is no negative prompt (CFG-distilled), so state exclusions as sentences.\n\n**Settings**: 20 steps (Turbo LoRA: 6-8), res_multistep, simple, shift 12 (video; audio 3 in\n**ModelSamplingMiniMaxH3**), short side 768 (1344×768, 768×1344, 1024×1024; multiples of 32), 24 fps.\n**Length** (frames, in **MiniMax H3 Image to Video**) snaps up to 17k+5: 124 ≈ 5 s, 192 = 8 s, 243 ≈ 10 s,\n362 ≈ 15 s (the trained range).\n\n## Image Bench\n\n| Marker | Node | Generate tab |\n|--------|------|--------------|\n| `ib:cp` | Load Diffusion Model | model list |\n| `ib:pp` | Image Bench Prompt | prompt and LoRA list |\n| `ib:smp` | SamplerCustomAdvanced | seed (RandomNoise), steps and scheduler (BasicScheduler), sampling method, Shift (ModelSamplingMiniMaxH3), size (MiniMax H3 Image to Video) |\n| `ib:ref:0` | First frame (bypassed) | References panel, first image |\n| `ib:ref:1` | Last frame (bypassed) | References panel, second image |\n| `ib:ext` | Extend from video (bypassed) | \"Extend video\" image action |\n| `ib:lora` | Load LoRA (bypassed) | LoRA exploration only |\n\n**Length** is the Frames field of the Video tab (beside Sampling), which keeps it on the 17k+5 grid.\n\n**Frames**: add images in the References panel of the Generate tab: the first one becomes the first frame, the\nsecond one the last frame. An empty slot is bypassed; the node takes both inputs as optional. The first frame is\nstretched to the size, the last one cover-cropped, so give the first frame the aspect ratio of the video.\n\n**Turbo LoRA**: enable **Turbo LoRA** (Ctrl+B) and set 6-8 steps. Other LoRAs: the LoRA list of the Generate\ntab or `<lora:name:weight>` in the prompt.\n\n**Extend video**: the \"Extend video\" action (X) of a video card loads it into **Extend from video**: its last 22\nframes (**Image From Batch**) become a guide at frame 0 (**Extend guide**), so the new clip continues it.\nDescribe what happens next in the prompt. The new clip begins with those 22 frames; join the clips in an editor.\nThe References panel lists the video as \"Extends\"; remove it there to bypass the group again.\n\nThe output is an MP4 with sound (**Save Video**); it arrives in the Generated tab as a video card.\n\n## Model Links\n\n[Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n\n**diffusion_models**: [minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n**text_encoders**: [qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors)\n**vae**: [minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors), [minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3/resolve/main/vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors)\n**loras** (optional): [minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Minimax-h3-Turbo/resolve/main/minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors)\n"
      ],
      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3 (Image Bench)",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
